Z||000015||Cliff Pennock||11-13-2001||07:48 PM||||I've been thinking about the "number of times viewed" option, but I'm not sure if it's worth the extra space it takes on the topic pages. The reason is simple, because every single topic is viewed dozens (if not hundreds) of times per day. So if you are not getting any response, it's either because people don't have an answer (yet), or because they are not interested in the topic. So you really shouldn't be concerned it hasn't been viewed yet.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
